Negative control for filter-wire.test.ts.

Binds the Verified branch to a different WIRE column, so the control writes the
same model and the translator emits it under a key the API does not filter on.
Nothing about the rendered bar changes. Any assertion that reads the translated
wire key goes red; one that reads only the model the control wrote — the shape
this file exists NOT to assert — stays green.

